    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/d330977f014fe7a4f17d7b7549495c5c.webp?t=1626753413\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mix of SciFi &amp; Fantasy</h2>Embark on a magical adventure between a cyberpunk and a medieval world. Defeat enemies and make friends along the way, and keep the deteriorating world safe. Upgrade your skills and your own basement, a haven where you can stay. Enjoy intense gameplay and plot, with nicely paced mini games and puzzles.\u00a0The story took inspiration from Hong Kong recent historical events, yet the story and characters are purely fictional.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/180a75202e275a9748cee50fa5fbb19a.poster.avif?t=1626753413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/180a75202e275a9748cee50fa5fbb19a.webm?t=1626753413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/180a75202e275a9748cee50fa5fbb19a.mp4?t=1626753413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle with up to 20 different skills, each with 3 upgrades. Combine the use of spells to develop unique play style.<br></li><li>Make decisions that decide the fate of characters and the world. A story with 2 endings with minor variations. Your choice matters.<br></li><li>Upgrade basement to unlock new activities and side-quests. A safe place to chill albeit the storms outside.<br></li><li>Play puzzle-solving tasks and mini-games along the journey.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/d330977f014fe7a4f17d7b7549495c5c.webp?t=1626753413\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mix of SciFi &amp; Fantasy</h2>Embark on a magical adventure between a cyberpunk and a medieval world. Defeat enemies and make friends along the way, and keep the deteriorating world safe. Upgrade your skills and your own basement, a haven where you can stay. Enjoy intense gameplay and plot, with nicely paced mini games and puzzles.\u00a0The story took inspiration from Hong Kong recent historical events, yet the story and characters are purely fictional.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/180a75202e275a9748cee50fa5fbb19a.poster.avif?t=1626753413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/180a75202e275a9748cee50fa5fbb19a.webm?t=1626753413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574190/extras/180a75202e275a9748cee50fa5fbb19a.mp4?t=1626753413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle with up to 20 different skills, each with 3 upgrades. Combine the use of spells to develop unique play style.<br></li><li>Make decisions that decide the fate of characters and the world. A story with 2 endings with minor variations. Your choice matters.<br></li><li>Upgrade basement to unlock new activities and side-quests. A safe place to chill albeit the storms outside.<br></li><li>Play puzzle-solving tasks and mini-games along the journey.</li></ul>",
